APPLICATION 8 : Create an Invoice Automatically

Steps

1.	Create an Invoice Templat
Open Microsoft Word.
   	Create a blank Word document.
    	Save it as  InvoiceTemplate.docx .

2 .Open UiPath Studio

   	Create a new Process

3. Add Word Application Scope

   	Drag Word Application Scope into the workflow.
   	 Browse and select the  “InvoiceTemplate.docx” file.

4.Add Type Into

   	 Inside the Word Application Scope, drag  Type Into.
   	 Indicate the Word document area.
   	Enter the invoice details, within double quotes 
 	Choose verify as Auto 

  “ INVOICE
   Customer: ABC College
   Product: Laptop
   Amount: 50000”
   
5. Run the Program

   	Click Run.
   	 UiPath automatically opens the Word template and types the invoice details.
   	



**Output:** Automatically filled invoice
